  "steps": [
   "Quadratic: find second differences to get a, then subtract an^2",
   "Find the linear nth term of the remainder for b and c",
   "Functions: fg(x) means f(g(x)); inverse: swap x and y",
   "Iteration: plug x_n into the formula to get x_{n+1}"
